My third Samurai has ascended.  My last two were on PC Nethack, this one was
on Unix Nethack.  

First, a quick summary (may contain spoilers)...

It took forever to get this character going.  I was waiting on two things
before I could proceed:  I needed a bag of holding (constant stress is not
good for your character's health), and I needed to get high enough to go on
my quest (I agree with the view that you should be able to go on your quest
at whatever level you want).  As it turns out, both of them came along at
the same time.  After finally finding a wraith corpse to take me to 14th
level and starting the quest, I found not one but two bags of holding on
level 3 of the quest.  Once I had that, the rest of the game was rather
routine.  Well, almost...

I had no problems until I was in the endgame on the Plane of Air.  There, I
tried to cast an identify spell to check out some items in my inventory.  
Without warning, I suddenly fainted from hunger as a result of casting the
spell.  This is not good when you have two dragons and an air elemental in
the vicinity.  After being hammered by both dragons and swallowed and 
expelled by the air elemental, I was down to 120 hit points out of 400.  I
was then swallowed by a steam vortex, which turned out to be a life saver.
The vortex's attacks didn't harm me, and I was safe from everything else, so
I was able to eat and recover some hit points.  After it expelled me, I just
waited around for it to swallow me again.  Eventually, I was back up to
around 300 and had no problems from there (except a slight problem finding
the portal on the Plane of Water, but eventually my ring of searching showed
me the way).  I wound up ascending with 5927956 points.

